# OpenWiki ignore patterns — TingTing
# Keep secrets, generated artifacts, and agent runtime state out of generated docs.
# Negation rules use `!` and re-include a path that an earlier rule excluded.

# --- Secrets / credentials / env ---
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
**/secrets/
**/*.pem
**/*.key

# --- OS / editor junk ---
.DS_Store
._*
Thumbs.db
.vscode/
.idea/
*.iml
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.cursor/
.codex/

# --- AI agent runtime & orchestration state (not source of truth) ---
.claude/
!.claude/skills/
!.claude/skills/**
!.claude/hooks/
!.claude/hooks/**
.claude/settings.local.json
.omc/
CLAUDE.local.md
AGENTS.local.md
.agents/

# --- Build output / caches / generated artifacts ---
node_modules/
**/__pycache__/
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/
**/.mypy_cache/
**/dist/
**/build/
**/.next/
**/.cache/
**/coverage/
**/.nyc_output/
**/__screenshots__/
**/.eslintcache
.npm
.eslintcache
.repomix*
repomix-output.xml
.graphify-cache/
graphify-out/

# --- Production backups (DB dumps + secrets) ---
backups/
.zcode/

# --- Logs / dumps ---
*.log
*.dump

# --- shadcn/ui generated primitives (auto-generated, not project-specific) ---
frontend/src/components/ui/

# --- Claude outputs and superseded tooling artifacts ---
Claude outputs/